        {
          "id": "3a304ad2-6017-595e-bbd3-3daa867c64b7",
          "alias": "埃及遗迹",
          "prompt": "1girl,solo,1.6::reclining in the shadows of a ruined nile temple at night,illuminated by moonlight and the faint glow of ancient pigments on the walls::,1.5::a relaxed,regal pose,one hand adjusting an elaborate wig as a strap of her ceremonial armor slips from her shoulder,revealing her back fully to the cool night air::,1.5::a golden chestplate secured by crossed scarab-embossed straps,leaving a diamond-shaped opening above her left breast where skin dusted with powdered lapis lazuli is visible,hieratic script painted in ochre along her spine::,1.4::moonlight catches the metallic gleam of the armor and the subtle shimmer of the pigments on her skin,while the ancient paint of the eye of horus watches from behind::,1.3::textures of polished gold,powdered mineral skin,rough stone walls,woven wig fibers,and dry desert air::,1.2::background of crumbling temple columns and fragmented murals under a star-filled desert sky,steeped in silence and history::,masterpiece,pharaonic intimacy,a portrait where divine adornment and mortal inscription merge under the moon's timeless gaze.",
