        {
          "id": "705c421f-31a5-5ca9-85a2-a7d0f9b08fa1",
          "alias": "Tag版本改编后：__003",
          "prompt": "close-up,cyberpunk,neon-lit tattoos,leap,robotic monsters,fisheye,flowing hair,metallic claws,electric sparks,purple and blue neon lights,ruined cityscape,midriff,high-heeled boots with spikes,smirk,shattered glass,laser beams,原Tag：,long legs,curvy,large thighs,wide hips,solo focus,revealing clothes,explicit,nipples,outdoors,standing,incoming attack,fishnet bodystocking,earrings,emblem,necklace,fingerless gloves,cleavage,white mechanical arms,mechanical energy claws,white mechanical legs,mechanical limbs,dark cyberpunk aesthetic,glitch art effects,neon-noir lighting,chaotic energy,psychological horror elements,digital distortion,high-contrast shading,electric pink and violet color scheme,grunge texture,cinematic dramatic lighting,bioluminescent details,punk rebellion theme,rain-soaked neon alleyway,flickering holographic billboards (japanese text + distorted ads),floating digital glitch particles,reflective wet pavement,acid rain droplets,broken vending machine (pink glow),cyber city skyline background,deep purple fog,dynamic camera angle (low-angle shot),原Tag：,this is a female robot in the assembly or awakening stage. her body has an elegant and slender silhouette,but most of her body still exposes the internal precise mechanical skeleton and servo systems. her upper body is covered with some smooth,white ceramic - like shells,but there are obvious seams and unclosed buckles between the shells,indicating her unfinished state. from her exposed spine and neck,countless black and gray cables of different thicknesses extend. these cables hang down like a waterfall. some are connected to a huge,unknown server or life - support system behind her,while others twine around her waist and limbs like vines. the interfaces at the ends are suspended in the air,waiting to be connected to the modules in the next stage. her head is already formed,with a delicate and expressionless face and eyes closed. however,the back half of her head is open,and the complex circuit boards and faintly glowing fiber - optic bundles inside can be seen. these fibers also converge into a data cable,which is connected to external devices. one of her arms has a complete arm shell installed,while the other remains in the mechanical skeleton stage,with the finger joints and drive devices clearly visible. the entire scene is presented in black - and - white monochrome,with lines as precise and sharp as an architectural blueprint,full of technical details. the light shines intensively from one direction,creating a strong contrast between the highlighted shells and the matte mechanical skeletons,highlighting the cold mechanical texture and the beauty of the structure,and creating an atmosphere that is both grand and full of mystery. she is both a precise industrial creation and an \"eve\" about to be given life,quietly suspended in the complex mechanical and data flow.,this is a female robot in the assembly or awakening stage. her body has an elegant and slender silhouette,but most of her body still exposes the internal precise mechanical skeleton and servo systems. her upper body is covered with some smooth,white ceramic - like shells,but there are obvious seams and unclosed buckles between the shells,indicating her unfinished state. from her exposed spine and neck,countless black and gray cables of different thicknesses extend. these cables hang down like a waterfall. some are connected to a huge,unknown server or life - support system behind her,while others twine around her waist and limbs like vines. the interfaces at the ends are suspended in the air,waiting to be connected to the modules in the next stage. her head is already formed,with a delicate and expressionless face and eyes closed. however,the back half of her head is open,and the complex circuit boards and faintly glowing fiber - optic bundles inside can be seen. these fibers also converge into a data cable,which is connected to external devices.,原Tag：,a dynamic fantasy illustration with a cool aesthetic,rendered with painterly textures and subtle brushwork. features an eerie,surreal atmosphere,employing dramatic,high-contrast lighting like rim light or backlighting,and glowing elements to evoke a mythic,poignant narrative.{{{dramatic angle,dynamic angle,dynamic pose}}},simple background,mecha,lion,super robot,broken,damaged,facing viewer,cowboy shot,mechanical,glowing eyes,drill,mechanical mask,原Tag：,the scene is depicted with bright,even illumination consistent with a retail environment. the image portrays an aisle within what appears to be a hobby or model kit store,densely stocked with merchandise. white metal shelving units line the walls,filled neatly with numerous packaged model kits. the boxes predominantly feature artwork of futuristic mecha,spaceships,and particularly female characters integrated with cybernetic or mechanical components,rendered in a similar anime aesthetic. many boxes share a color scheme involving shades of pink,white,and grey,suggesting a specific product line or theme.dominating the central background is a large,eye-catching vertical display or poster showcasing a detailed illustration of a female character. this character embodies a blend of human and machine,clad in minimal,form-fitting cybernetic armor that reveals significant portions of her physique while incorporating complex mechanical elements,including large weapon attachments and propulsion units extending from her back and arms. she has long,dark hair and large,expressive eyes typical of the genre,gazing towards the viewer.in the foreground and midground,shoppers interact with the environment. on the right,a young boy and a slightly younger girl,presumably siblings,are shown from the back and side respectively. the boy stands observing the shelves,while the girl reaches towards a stack of model kit boxes placed on the floor,seemingly examining them. both are dressed casually. partially visible in the extreme foreground is the head and shoulders of another young girl with similar hair color to the central character,adding depth to the scene but obscuring the lower portion of the view. the overall composition emphasizes the abundance of specialized merchandise and the consumer environment associated with anime and mecha model kits.,原Tag：,complex 3d render ultra detailed of a beautiful porcelain profile woman android face,cyborg,robotic parts,150 mm,beautiful studio soft light,rim light,vibrant details,luxurious cyberpunk,lace,hyperrealistic,anatomical,facial muscles,cable electric wires,microchip,octane render,h. r. giger style,robot,silver halmet,full body,sitting,human head,legs diverged slightly,原Tag：,this is a technical illustration in a detailed schematic style,featuring a predominantly monochrome (black ink on off-white grid paper) palette with a blue accent,characterized by precise yet slightly textured linework and texture rendering through detailed lines and stark black shading suggesting metallic surfaces.,the image utilizes strong,hard lighting,evidenced by the high-contrast shading on the subject and the distinct,sharp-edged blue shadow it casts upon the underlying grid.,presented as a technical blueprint on gridded paper,the central subject is a heavily armed,bipedal combat mech shown in a three-quarter perspective,angled slightly towards the viewer's left. the machine possesses a robust and utilitarian design,constructed from angular plates,exposed joints,and numerous mechanical components. its posture is stable,supported by powerful,reverse-jointed legs terminating in large,flat feet designed for traction and weight distribution. intricate details such as pistons,actuators,and segmented armor are visible on the limbs. the main chassis,or torso,is boxy and substantial,likely housing the primary systems and cockpit,indicated by a sloped front section with small sensor arrays or viewports. prominently mounted weaponry includes two large cannons extending backwards over the shoulders and a multi-barrel rotary cannon affixed to the front-left aspect of the torso. the illustration employs heavy black ink for shading,utilizing both solid fills and dense cross-hatching to convey form,depth,and the metallic nature of the mech's surfaces. surrounding the mech are various elements typical of a schematic diagram,including text boxes,leader lines pointing to specific components (labeled with placeholder text like \"power system,\" \"weapon system,\" \"control system\"),inset diagrams showing alternate views or details in the lower-left corner,and title blocks in the upper-left and lower-right corners. a distinctive solid blue shadow is cast by the mech onto the grid background,indicating a directional light source from the upper left and adding a layer of dimensionality to the otherwise flat presentation format.,原Tag：,A serene,ethereal world with a girl standing on a flat surface. The sky is vast and blue,dotted with fluffy white clouds. The girl has long,flowing hair and is dressed in a light,airy outfit,reflecting the peaceful atmosphere. Her figure is mirrored in the calm water below her feet,creating a mesmerizing reflection. The overall style is anime-inspired,with soft,pastel colors and gentle,dreamlike lighting. The scene captures a sense of tranquility and wonder,blending nature and the fantastical.,原Tag：,the scene is characterized by very strong lighting originating from the horizon,creating dramatic light and moody lighting effects with intense highlights on the water. the artwork depicts a solitary figure,appearing as a young woman with dark,shoulder-length hair,standing submerged to her thighs in a body of water that stretches towards a luminous horizon. positioned off-center,she is presented mostly in silhouette against the brilliant glare of a setting or rising sun. her gaze is directed downwards,towards the water before her,suggesting a moment of quiet contemplation or introspection. the sun's reflection creates a dazzling path of light across the water's surface,rendered in fragmented patches of bright yellow,white,pink,and iridescent blues,conveying the shimmering quality of light on gentle waves. the water transitions from these vibrant,light-filled areas to deeper,cooler shades of purple and blue in the foreground. the sky above mirrors the water's palette,shifting from warm hues near the horizon to a pale,clear blue. despite the figure's silhouetted form,subtle variations in color hint at the ambient light catching her hair and clothing,adding depth to her presence within the tranquil,ethereal waterscape. the overall atmosphere is one of serene solitude,enhanced by the expressive,painterly execution and the evocative use of light and color.,原Tag：,a girl stands amidst twisted vines with glowing eyes,her bare feet entangled by thorny roots emerging from cracked soil. jagged branches spiral around her torso like skeletal hands,their bark pulsating with faint crimson veins. clusters of bioluminescent flowers bloom nearby,petals releasing shimmering spores that cling to her torn dress. shadowy cat-like creatures with glowing amber eyes peer from gnarled tree hollows,their claws scraping against petrified wood. thin rivulets of blood trickle down her ankles where barbed tendrils pierce the skin,droplets crystallizing upon touching the ashen ground. a low-hanging mist swirls with fragmented whispers,distorting the girl's silhouette into wavering afterimages under dim blue-green light.,原Tag：,stream of consciousness,dream core,award-winning works of art photography,sense of ambiguity,significant effect of invisibility,minimalist,overhead shooting perspective,loss,decadence,surrealist portrait photography of women,the whole body is tied to the opaque long white cloth back around pulling,unclean lens,atmosphere immersion,ground-glass feeling of fuzzy effect,granular layer,advanced sense,vivid and perfect details,原Tag：,the silhouette is black,with two glowing eyes that emit a bright,intense light. neon colors,including electric blue,vibrant pink,and radiant green,wrap themselves around the silhouette,creating dynamic,swirling patterns. the background is filled with bold and colorful geometric shapes. the overall composition is lively and energetic,with a strong focus on the detailed and vivid elements of the central figure and the vibrant background,原Tag：,holding weapon,staff,weapon on back,headband,red headband,jacket,white coat,red vest,striped sleeves,black shirt,black shorts,black gloves,boots,standing,full body,looking at viewer,door,open door,doorway in the sky,exit sign,glowing sign,holding door,hand on doorknob,stepping out,surreal,scenery,night,night sky,star (sky),moon,crescent moon,bird,clouds,clouds in foreground,field,grass,house,text,english text,warm lighting,glowing,the image features a female character,centrally positioned and framed within a brightly lit,open doorway. she is depicted mid-stride,stepping forward through the doorway towards the viewer,with her body angled slightly to her left (viewer's right) while her head is turned to look directly forward. her left hand is positioned on the handle of the open door,holding it steady. the doorway itself acts as a portal,located in the middle ground of the composition,seemingly floating in a dark night sky. a large,fluffy mass of clouds occupies the entire foreground,situated at the character's feet and below the floating doorway,obscuring the bottom of the door and her lower legs,原Tag：,curled up in fetal position,translucent body,sitting inside a glass box,ethereal presence,calm expression,surrounded by blooming yellow flowers and violet foliage,symbolic isolation,glass walls,原Tag：,chinese cheongsam costume,dynamic pose,falling posture,cherry blossom petal,golden necklace,high heels,wet look,sparkling effect,{extreme long shot},{low angle},{from below},{tilted frame},deep water background,floating red ribbons,underwater bubbles,magical glow,vibrant pink and gold color scheme,silk fabric sheen,translucent petals clinging to skin,hair floating in liquid,distressed expression,detailed lace patterns on stockings,water surface refraction above,light rays piercing through water,原Tag：,this is a digital painting in a highly expressionist style,filled with a chaotic and violent energy. a vague human figure occupies the center of the frame. its facial features are rendered unrecognizable by rough,powerful brushstrokes and splattered colors,making it seem as if it's undergoing a violent disintegration or letting out a scream. the color palette is dominated by deep blacks,fiery reds,and stark yellows. these high-contrast colors collide and merge,creating a visual effect reminiscent of burning or an explosion. the brushwork is wild and unconventional,featuring a mix of heavy textures,sharp scratching marks,and splattered spots. these chaotic textures combine to construct the figure's inner turmoil,be it pain,rage,or ecstasy. light seems to burst forth from within the figure itself,especially in the facial area,where highlights of red and yellow resemble burning embers,creating a stark contrast with the surrounding darkness. the overall atmosphere of the painting is dark,surreal,and charged with a raw,unrestrained emotional power.,百合壁咚（n4）,2girls,black and white checkered wall,one girl pinning the other against wall,arms forming cage,flushed cheeks,averted gaze,messy bangs sticking to forehead,half-unbuttoned sailor collar,loose necktie,trembling fingers gripping sleeve,side view composition,faint steam effect,knee pressing against wall,choker with heart pendant,torn fishnet stockings,scattered school papers,neon sign glow bleeding from left frame,cherry lip gloss,bitten lower lip,stray hair strands floating,gradient shadow under chin,",
