          "id": "75f08211-c810-53df-a055-c99fe67d1523",
          "alias": "拥花",
          "prompt": "text,english text, 1girl,A delicate anime-style upper-body portrait of a young girl against a plain deep black background. Her head tilts gently downward,creating a quiet,graceful,and slightly melancholic mood. Soft light surrounds the figure,making the bright decorative elements stand out clearly against the dark,low-saturation background. She wears an elegant white hat decorated with white roses,pale blue floral accents,fresh green leaves,and hanging pearl strands. A pearl necklace rests around her neck,echoing the gentle shine of the pearls on the hat. In the foreground,a large bouquet of roses in white,pale blue,and vivid blue partially covers her chest,while several small white butterflies hover around the flowers and near her shoulders. The overall palette is cool and refined,dominated by black,white,pale blue,and vivid blue,with bright highlights on the flowers,pearls,and butterflies,creating a dreamy,mysterious,and poetic atmosphere. bouquet,holding_bouquet,closed_eyes ,2::colorful::,2::high contrast::,1::simple background::, chromatic aberration,film grain, photographic reference,photo background,3d background,3D render,3DCG, 3::cinematic angle,cinematic lighting::,3::sidelighting,bloom light,rim lighting::,3::colorful::,chromatic aberration, lens flare,light particles, from side,highly finished,Character Study,amazing quality,absurdres,best quality,Text:the world",
