          "alias": "鲜花与死亡（5）",
          "prompt": "1girl,a girl with a partially skeletal face wearing a large hat and frilled dress standing against a plain background,centered subject,waist-up crop,wide-brimmed hat,blue roses,red flowers,red butterflies,frilled dress,black gloves,blue beaded jewelry,ribbon,skull-like facial detail,skeletal skull structure on the right side of the face with red flowers growing from it,slight smile,white long-sleeved frilled dress,large blue ribbon at the collar,strands of blue beaded jewelry,black gloves,large white hat with a dark ruffled underside and blue roses on top,hanging dark ribbon with a jewel,slight,closed-mouth smile,looking at the viewer,standing,raising her left hand to hold the brim of her hat,holding her hat,surrounded by butterflies and flowers,$character 1$ is a girl shown from the waist up in a cowboy shot. the right side of her face reveals a white,skeletal skull structure,from which several small red flowers bloom. she is positioned against a plain,solid white background. she wears a large,wide-brimmed white hat decorated with several pale blue roses along the crown; the underside of the brim is dark and ruffled. a thin black cord with a blue and gold jewel hangs from the hat. her outfit is a white,long-sleeved dress with multiple layers of frills at the shoulders,neck,and cuffs. a prominent blue ribbon is tied at her throat,and several strands of blue beaded jewelry are draped across her chest. $character 1$ wears dark black gloves on both hands,with her left hand raised to grasp the brim of her hat while her right arm rests at her side. to her left,two large red flowers are stacked vertically,and several more small red flowers are clustered near her right shoulder. multiple red butterflies of various sizes appear to be flying around her. she maintains a slight,closed-mouth smile while looking directly at the viewer.</caption>.the women has huge breasts.",
